[mod] [CommunityFixPack] CaveInsNoDisasters [active] Cave-ins no longer occur when the "No Disasters" game rule is active
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] MeteorFrequency [active] Meteors strike on their designed 35-115h schedule instead of ~every 6 hours
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] UpgradeModifierLeak [active] Salvaging an upgraded building now removes its dome/colony-wide upgrade bonuses
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] NightShiftWork [active] Night-shift colonists go to work after midnight instead of skipping their shift
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] MilestoneCrash [active] Completing all milestones no longer errors in No Terraforming / No Politics games
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] WispRewards [active] Mystery 11: "free the wisps" produces real power; destroyed-wisp rewards match the notification
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] TouristApplicants [active] Higher tourist ratings now correctly give more bonus applicants (roll was inverted)
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] TrainsToVoid [active] Demolishing a station stores its trains instead of permanently deleting them
						Lua 0:31:16:183
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] LanderEmptyLaunch [active] Automatic rockets and asteroid landers wait for cargo instead of launching empty
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] LanderCargoRatchet [active] Automatic rockets stop unloading the cargo they just loaded, and fill up with the valuable resources first
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] LanderReturnFuel [active] Asteroid landers keep their return fuel instead of unloading it on the asteroid
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] ShelterReflex [active] Asteroid colonists take shelter before suffocating, and keep their habitat through power blips
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] BrokenTrackSalvage [active] Meteor-damaged tracks can be salvaged again
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] TrackSalvageWipe [active] Salvaging one track piece no longer deletes the whole track and its trains
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] LakeEntombment [active] Building an artificial lake no longer entombs the RC Constructor and drones
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] GhostFarmOxygen [active] Salvaging a farm removes the oxygen it was giving its dome
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] RocketDroneChurn [active] Landed rockets stop sending their delivery drones back to Idle every hour
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] ShuttleTransportCache [active] New Shuttle Hubs are noticed: colonists stop being stuck with a cached 'unreachable'
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] VacuumWalks [active] Colonists use the passages instead of crossing vacuum on foot between nearby domes
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] ArrivalDeaths [active] Arriving colonists no longer hike to unreachable domes or land in impassable ground
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] DroneUnreachableForever [active] Drones re-try buildings they once failed to reach instead of writing them off forever
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] StaleReservations [active] Housing reserved for colonists that never arrive is released again
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] CrystalMysteryHang [active] The Philosopher's Stone mystery can no longer hang forever at the finale
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] TouristSatisfaction [active] Tourist satisfaction stops drifting down (threshold awards are now symmetric)
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] TrainPlatformWedge [active] A stale passenger no longer wedges a train at the platform forever
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] LowStorageWarning [active] The "Insufficient Resources" warning works again for Food and maintenance resources
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] CommandCenterNumbers [active] Command Center resource rows show their numbers again
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] DomeOverviewHighlight [active] Domes Overview marks low colonist stats in red again
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] TrainCargoDumping [active] Trains stop dumping cargo at stations where that resource is switched off
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] UniversityOvertraining [active] Universities stop training specialists for workplaces that run themselves
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] DestroyedTunnels [active] Destroyed tunnels stay closed after loading a save instead of rejoining pathfinding
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] DustSicknessBiorobots [active] Dust Sickness no longer infects Biorobots
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] DustSicknessDamage [active] Dust Sickness deals its intended random damage instead of the maximum every sol
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] GeneForging [active] The Gene Forging tech actually increases the rare-trait chance
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] MirrorSphereSite [active] A completed Mirror Sphere site no longer accepts more drone work
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] PayloadTemplateRefill [active] Edit Payload keeps the amounts you set instead of refilling them from the flight-policy template
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] AsteroidLanderAvailable [active] The asteroid-expedition gate counts landed landers, and stops counting supply rockets
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] ShuttleHubOffAvailable [active] Shuttle Hubs switched off no longer count as available colonist transport
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] FreedHousingNotice [active] A home falling vacant is offered to the dome's homeless straight away
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] DomeFreeSpaceMismatch [active] A dome's free-housing total counts the same residences the game assigns colonists to
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] SmallLandscapeSites [active] Drones no longer error out when sent to a small landscaping site
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] LandscapeUnitFilter [active] Landscaping over a boarding point no longer drags boarding colonists out
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] RocketInteractGuard [active] RC Transports stay off trade and refugee rockets again
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] TrackConnectorPingPong [active] A station and a tunnel one hex apart stop stealing each other's track connector
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] TrackTunnelPowerBridge [active] A station attached to a train tunnel bridges the power grid again
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] GridGlobalStorage [active] Colony-wide power/water/oxygen reserve is measured as one ratio again
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] LastTransmissionStorage [active] Last Transmission's power/water/oxygen storage opinions actually count
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] GraphConsumedCaption [active] Command Center graph captions count maintenance, like the bars do
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] MoraleComfortTooltip [active] Morale tooltip stops listing a Comfort bonus the game does not apply
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] TrainWaitTime [active] Waiting on a train platform no longer counts as time spent riding
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] FounderTraitNotification [active] The notification for a Founder gaining a trait fires again
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] StorageRateModifiers [active] Charge and discharge rate modifiers on batteries and tanks take effect
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] SequenceLatents [active] Sequence label sampling and the Digger timing swap behave as written
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] IndependenceTerraforming [active] Independent Terraforming discounts special projects by the 20% it advertises
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] TrackSalvageRefund [active] Salvaging a track refunds what the whole track cost, not one hex
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] LayoutTechLock [active] Layout construction respects research locks
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] TrainMinors [active] Train cap follows track length
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] DroneTransportMinors [active] A passability change no longer corrupts each drone's unreachable-buildings table
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] AnomalyCaveInMap [active] A cave-in on a map that does not exist is declined instead of crashing the sequence
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] TechDescriptionBuilding [active] The Underground Medium Dome tech description names the building it actually unlocks
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] BombardmentSpread [active] Bombardment missiles come in from spread directions instead of in parallel
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] ExtenderFlapChurn [active] Extender power flickers no longer tear down and rebuild the whole hub (fleet-wide Idle churn)
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] DisasterPredictionLeak [active] A finished meteor storm no longer disables rains, cold waves and dust storms forever
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] MeteorStormWedge [active] A wedged meteor storm is detected and released instead of blocking storms forever
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] RainsDeadlock [active] A rain that collides with another disaster retries instead of never raining again
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] FirstAsteroidPrefabs [active] The First Asteroid prefabs still arrive if the popup was left unanswered across a save/load
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] SaintBlessing [active] A Saint's blessing reaches the Religious colonists in their dome
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] DustDevilsDescrMap [active] Dust devils on the surface use the surface's settings, not the map the camera is on
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] AstrogeologistExtractors [active] The Astrogeologist bonus reaches every buildable extractor, as its own text promises
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] SinkholeIndestructible [active] A meteor can no longer destroy the St. Elmo's Fire sinkhole
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] DustStormUndergroundBreaks [active] A surface dust storm can no longer break cables and pipes underground
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] DustDevilSpawnGate [active] Dust devil waves use their authored count range instead of being scaled down by the spawn chance
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] SaveSanitizer [active] Savegame repair: lost Wind Turbine tech buff, leaked upgrade bonuses
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] ClassicRockets [active] OPTIONAL: rockets refuel while parked, without a destination selected
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] AcknowledgedWarnings [active] OPTIONAL: dismissing "Building Not Working" acknowledges those buildings until they recover
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] ResidencyControl [active] OPTIONAL: per-dome "closed to new residents" policy — no quarantine involved
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] MultipleSuns [active] OPTIONAL: build more than one Artificial Sun (and panels bind to any sun in range)
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] DroneOverhaul [active] OPTIONAL: drone dispatch overhaul — closest fleet gets first claim on repairs; idle drones help overloaded neighbor hubs
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] CohortHousing [active] OPTIONAL: Seniors/Children auto-move to free Retirement Home/Nursery slots
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] NoHomeless [active] OPTIONAL: per-dome Nursery/Retirement policy — moves out homeless UNEMPLOYED colonists, unless the dome has a job opening
[mod] [CommunityFixPack] DroneStatDials [active] OPTIONAL: Drone speed / carry capacity dials (set them in Mod Options)
